`form 53 para 3 information will be collected` MEANS
    IF `the person is subject to the obligation`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Information relating to you will be collected under sections 5 and 6 of the Sex Offender Information Registration Act by a person who collects information at the registration centre": the notice speaks of the person it is given to

