            THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "You have the right to apply to a court to vary the duration of the obligation to comply with the Sex Offender Information Registration Act": the right is that of the person the notice is given to
        IF `the obligation applies for life because the person was convicted or found not criminally responsible for more than one offence`
            THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "if the obligation applies for life because you were convicted or found not criminally responsible on account of mental disorder for more than one offence"

@ref Form 54 (Sections 490.02901 to 490.02903, 490.02905 and 490.032) (src:19046)
